	(text_box "VXDash RemoteECU\n\nFeatures:\n- 4x Analogue resistive sensor inputs.\n- 4x Analogue voltage sensor inputs.\n- 3x PWM sensor inputs.\n- 8x Digital inputs. (4x active high, 4x active low).\n- 4x Outputs. (low-side driver)\n- CAN interface (comms to main VXDash).\n\nTODO:\n- Explore simultaneous sampling ADC instead of merry-go-round ADS1115\n- Add idiot lights\n- Add button parts/footprints\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 0 -74.93 0)
		(size 92.71 74.93)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
